  data: {
    LLM: '1. Ante bet (and optional Pair Plus). 2. Deal 3 cards. 3. Player decides to Play (match Ante) or Fold (lose Ante). 4. Dealer reveals hand. Dealer must qualify with Queen High or better. 5. Compare hands. Scoring: Straight Flush > Three of a Kind > Straight > Flush > Pair > High Card. (Note: Straight beats Flush in 3-card poker, usually).',
    Player: '1. Ante bet (and optional Pair Plus). 2. Deal 3 cards. 3. Player decides to Play (match Ante) or Fold (lose Ante). 4. Dealer reveals hand. Dealer must qualify with Queen High or better. 5. Compare hands. Scoring: Straight Flush > Three of a Kind > Straight > Flush > Pair > High Card. (Note: Straight beats Flush in 3-card poker, usually).',
